OL,3,CGrandfather jailed for trying to make
OL,4,C3D gun
OL,6,FA grandfather has been jailed for four-
OL,7,Fand-a-half-years for attempting to
OL,8,Fmake a 3D printed gun.
OL,10,FDavid Boylett, 62, was just 15 minutes
OL,11,Faway from completing the weapon before
OL,12,Fofficers raided his home in Telford in
OL,13,FJuly 2021.
OL,15,FAs well as the partially completed
OL,16,Ffirearm, investigators also found an
OL,17,Farray of firearms components, tools
OL,18,Fand two 3D printers.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
