PN,34602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786524485
OL,3,CGrandfather jailed for trying to make
OL,4,C3D gun
OL,6,FForensics experts later confirmed the
OL,7,Funemployed 62-year-old only needed an
OL,8,Fadditional 15 minutes to remove excess
OL,9,Fpolymer and make the weapon function
OL,10,Ffully.
OL,12,FAnalysis of Boylett's computer and
OL,13,Fmemory card revealed the intensity of
OL,14,Fhis gun obsession.
OL,16,FPiles of documents were found on
OL,17,Fconverting firearms, making ammunition
OL,18,Fand using 3D printers.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786524485
OL,3,CGrandfather jailed for trying to make
OL,4,C3D gun
OL,6,FOne folder titled 'naughty stuff'
OL,7,Fcontained instructional videos for the
OL,8,Fsame model of firearm seized from his
OL,9,Fproperty.
OL,11,FBoylett's mobile phone also contained
OL,12,Fa video of his 3D printer producing
OL,13,Fone of the firearm components of the
OL,14,Ftype recovered from his property.
OL,16,FFirearms experts used the recovered
OL,17,Ffiles to print the remaining parts
OL,18,Frequired to complete the firearm and
OL,19,Fconducted a successful test fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
