FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786524485
OL,3,CGrandfather jailed for trying to make
OL,4,C3D gun
OL,6,FA powerful air rifle and ammunition
OL,7,Fwere also recovered from the scene, as
OL,8,Fwell as a shotgun part which was
OL,9,Fstolen from a vehicle in Herefordshire
OL,10,Fin April 2012.
OL,12,FIn January 2026, he pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Fattempting to possess a component part
OL,14,Fof a prohibited firearm; possessing
OL,15,Fammunition and an overpowered air
OL,16,Frifle without a licence.
OL,18,FAt Shrewsbury Crown Court today
OL,19,F(August 10th), Boylett was sentenced
OL,20,Fto four-and-a-half-years in jail.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
