PN,34605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786524485
OL,3,CGrandfather jailed for trying to make
OL,4,C3D gun
OL,6,FThe court heard how that there's no
OL,7,Fevidence to suggest what he was going
OL,8,Fto do with the firearm if he completed
OL,9,Fit.
OL,11,FNCA Senior Investigating Officer Niall
OL,12,FConner said: "Boylett was in the
OL,13,Fprocess of creating deadly weapons
OL,14,Fthat could have done untold harm to
OL,15,Findividuals in our communities.
OL,17,F"The depth of his research into 3D
OL,18,Fprinted firearms demonstrates his
OL,19,Fobsession and intent with the tools in
OL,20,Fhis possession.
OL,26,@tD@NOUyD@AOU
